{
  "uid": "logs",
  "title": "Logs — where everything goes",
  "description": "Every log line in one place, side by side: frontend (browser errors, web, gateway), backend (API) and the shared infrastructure (PostgreSQL, Redis, Loki, Grafana). Where each comes from, how it is labelled and how long it is kept. See the deploy repository's README (Dashboards and alerts).",
