  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Where every log goes.** Every pod only writes to stdout; a collector (Alloy) reads those lines and pushes them to **Loki**, and Grafana reads Loki. All of it runs in the cluster, in the namespace `infra`. The browser is the exception: it cannot write anywhere we can read, so the web app reports its **errors** (only those) through the gateway.\n\n| Source | Collected by | Query it with |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Browser** (the Angular app): uncaught errors, unhandled rejections, Angular's ErrorHandler, `console.error` | Grafana Faro SDK → gateway `POST /collect` → Alloy `faro.receiver` in the cluster | `{namespace=\"browser\"}`, level `error`; per line: `page` (no query string), `user`, `app_version`, `browser` |\n| **Pods**: gateway, web, API (and load tests, kube-system) | Alloy (namespace `infra`), through the Kubernetes API | `{namespace=\"product-management\", app=\"gateway\"}` (or `\"web\"`, `\"api\"`); API label `level`; per line: `trace_id`, gateway `status`, `user`, API `category` |\n| **Shared infrastructure**: PostgreSQL, Redis, Loki, Grafana (and the nightly backup) | the same Alloy: they are pods like any other | `{namespace=\"infra\", app=\"postgres\"}` (or `\"redis\"`, `\"loki\"`, `\"grafana\"`, `\"postgres-backup\"`) |\n\n**Stored:** Loki (StatefulSet `loki`, data on the volume `data-loki-0`; infra: `logs.yaml`), kept **14 days** and then deleted by Loki's compactor. **Variables:** *search* (any text, case-insensitive) and *trace_id* filter every panel; with a trace_id only the gateway and API lines of that request remain. *API level* filters the API panel. More: [deploy README](https://github.com/RubenCipriano/zeiss-product-management/blob/main/deploy/README.md#dashboards-and-alerts)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log lines per source",
      "description": "Every log line Loki received, per source (namespace / app), with the search and trace_id applied. A source that drops to zero has stopped logging, or its collector has stopped sending.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, app) (count_over_time({namespace=~\"browser|product-management|infra\"} | trace_id=~\"$trace_id.*\" |~ `(?i)${search:regex}` [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{app}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
